cff-version: 1.2.0
title: KI-Governance-Rahmenwerk
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as part of the SimpleAct AI Governance Framework."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: SimpleAct-Compliance
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/simpleact-ai-governance-framework"
license: MIT
abstract: "An operating model for AI governance under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 and the GDPR, organised around five control domains (governance, inventory, classification, documentation, monitoring), a five-phase lifecycle and the feedback path from monitoring back into assessment that most implementations lack. Covers the Art. 25 role switch from deployer to provider, the four properties that make a record usable as evidence, the six triggers that invalidate an assessment, and the application dates as amended by the Digital Omnibus."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - GDPR
  - AI governance
  - operating model
  - accountability
  - Article 4
  - Article 14
  - Article 25
  - Digital Omnibus
  - SimpleAct
